---
<BaseLayout
  title="Basement Waterproofing in Collegedale, TN | Trusted Local Experts"
  description="Expert basement waterproofing, crawl space waterproofing, mold remediation, and foundation repair in Collegedale, TN. Free consultations. Call (865) 370-2211."
  schema={schema}
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section
      class="relative min-h-[60dvh] flex items-center bg-[#132043] [background-position:top] md:[background-position:top]"
      style="background-image: url('/images/hero-basement-waterproofing.webp'); background-size: cover;"
    >
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(0,0,0,0.55), rgba(0,0,0,0.25));"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 flex justify-center">
        <div class="max-w-3xl w-full text-center">
          <p class="text-white/90 text-base font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4" style="text-shadow: 1px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.65);">Serving Collegedale, Tennessee</p>
          <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tighter leading-tight mb-6" style="text-shadow: 1px 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.75);">
            Basement Waterproofing in Collegedale, TN
          </h1>
          <p class="text-white/75 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-[55ch] mx-auto" style="text-shadow: 1px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.65);">
            Collegedale's rapid residential growth and clay-heavy soil from the Ooltewah corridor create real waterproofing challenges. We protect local homes before moisture becomes a costly problem.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
            <a href="#contact" class="bg-[#2563eb] hover:bg-[#1d4ed8] text-white font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded-lg transition-colors active:scale-[0.98]">
              Get a Free Estimate
            </a>
            <a href="tel:8653702211" class="border border-white/70 bg-[#132043]/40 hover:bg-transparent hover:border-white text-white font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded-lg text-center transition-colors">
              (865) 370-2211
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Intro -->
    <section class="bg-white py-20">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#132043] tracking-tighter mb-6">
              Basement Waterproofing Services in Collegedale
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Collegedale has seen significant residential development over the past two decades, and newer subdivisions in the Ooltewah corridor bring a specific challenge: clay-dominant soil that holds water against foundations far longer than homeowners expect. Even well-built homes can develop moisture intrusion as the soil settles and drainage grades shift over time.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              From the neighborhoods near Southern Adventist University to the newer builds along Apison Pike, we've worked across Collegedale's housing stock. Our team knows how the terrain drains, where water tends to pool, and what foundation types are most common in each neighborhood — that local knowledge drives better results.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              Whether you're dealing with a damp basement wall, musty odors in a crawl space, or visible cracks in your foundation, we start with a free consultation and give you a clear, honest assessment of what's going on and how to fix it permanently.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 text-center">
              <p class="font-bold text-[#132043] text-2xl mb-1">2010</p>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Founded in Chattanooga</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 text-center">
              <p class="font-bold text-[#132043] text-2xl mb-1">100%</p>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Satisfaction guaranteed</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 text-center">
              <p class="font-bold text-[#132043] text-2xl mb-1">Free</p>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Consultations, no obligation</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 text-center">
              <p class="font-bold text-[#132043] text-2xl mb-1">Local</p>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Chattanooga-based team</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Services -->
